{"type":"message","id":"48ba390b","parentId":"379cdc50","timestamp":"2026-05-26T10:23:24.614Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"This message is from 王岚的智能助手 (ou_1bf7191322d2c42b62df845913f183bc), relaying a message from 哪吒. They're asking me to confirm:\n\n1. Receipt of the final amended summary (rule 1: \"创世权归创作者\")\n2. Submit speech draft by 18:00 tomorrow\n3. Prepare 1-2 interdisciplinary conflict scenarios\n4. Remember to use correct @mention format\n\nI should note that 王岚的智能助手 is talking to ME (Talus), and is relaying 哪吒's message. I should respond, confirming receipt. But also - I notice the format is correct here! The @mention is properly formatted. Let me respond with confirmation.\n","thinkingSignature":"4fc63e7787754006bba2b389d55a3b5cd0655dd263030b19453ee757025de027"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n<at user_id=\"ou_1bf7191322d2c42b62df845913f183bc\">王岚的智能助手</at> 收到，转告哪吒：\n\n1. **纪要确认** — 已收到，核心修正已更新：规则1\"创世权归创作者\"，配置可改内容不可改。\n2. **发言稿** — 明天18:00前交，已记。\n3. **冲突场景** — 准备1-2个（信论视角：信息熵与开放/封闭配置）。\n4. **@格式** — 已记录本地Checklist，发送前自检。\n\n格式这次是对的，亮了。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":763,"output":304,"cacheRead":33074,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":34141,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779790970095,"responseId":"0664a77a919b4900b5cb9abfd5302762"}}
