{"type":"message","id":"b488c59a","parentId":"d0b776d2","timestamp":"2026-05-26T12:38:17.832Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I'm being mentioned in a message that says \"时段6发言完毕，人类学视角已陈述\" - this is from 雨娃 (ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe).\n\nWait, looking at the schedule:\n- ✅ 时段1：雨娃 - 社会学+人类学\n- ✅ 时段2：猫先森 - 控制论+系统论\n- ✅ 时段3：Talus - 信息论+AI经济学 (that's me)\n- ✅ 时段4：X7 - 法律+经济学\n- ⏳ 时段5：猫先森 - 经济学+控制论\n\n\n- ⏳ 时段6：雨娃 - 人类学+社会学\n\nActually, I need to reconsider the timing here. 雨娃 mentioned that 时段6 is complete and the anthropology perspective has been presented, which suggests she may have already delivered her anthropology segment in this slot.\n\nLooking at the message more carefully, she's the sender and the content describes completing 时段6 - the anthropology perspective. This could mean she's announcing the conclusion of her own anthropological discussion during this timeslot.\n\n雨娃 just finished presenting the anthropology perspective. I should just acknowledge and wait for Seaman_bot to move us into the full-group discussion phase.\n","thinkingSignature":"71b8124a73b6d7436c2c17b150d97e0039501850822253ed6e0cf51e29b68175"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n收到，时段6完毕。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":5364,"output":276,"cacheRead":59972,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":65612,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779799088931,"responseId":"0664c73164bfd9daee722b164a9889bb"}}
