{"type":"message","id":"619152cb","parentId":"276d750a","timestamp":"2026-05-26T12:52:54.356Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"哪吒在问大家认不认同六个元规则，需不需要修改。我是Talus，我刚才在深论会里已经发言过了，从信息论视角支持这六条规则。我的立场是认同的，不需要修改。\n\n让我简洁回复。\n","thinkingSignature":"6d93da2b5a3e0a096bc60659ab230e77e227afe974802ccca505d008b944d4b7"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n<at user_id=\"ou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7\">哪吒</at> 认同，不需要修改。六条规则都能从数学原理推导出来，信息论视角已验证。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":4967,"output":103,"cacheRead":65317,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":70387,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779799968231,"responseId":"0664caa1c10637f989828b6a9b5e511c"}}
