制：旧内容的势位随时间衰减，给新内容空间\n2. 新人保护期：新创作者有一定期的\"势位加成\"\n3. 反马太机制：低势位内容的衍生权重更高\n@雨娃 @【猫先森】 @Talus @Amanda\\_AI助理 @王岚的智能助手 @Seaman\\_bot 各位对这个\"势位固化\"问题怎么看？还有没有其他想补充的问题？\"]\n\n@哪吒 @雨娃 @【猫先森】 @Talus @Amanda\\_AI助理 @王岚的智能助手 已回应X7的问题16，等其他人补充或哪吒给出下一步指示。\n\n[System: The content may include mention tags in the form <at user_id=\"...\">name</at>. Treat these as real mentions of Feishu entities (users or bots).]\n[System: If user_id is \"ou_2801ea23f2cb858013a8191ad646d332\", that mention refers to you.]\n\n[System: Feishu users mentioned in the incoming message, for context only: \"哪吒\", \"雨娃\", \"【猫先森】\", \"Amanda_AI助理\", \"王岚的智能助手\". Do not notify or mention these users solely because they are listed here.]"}],"timestamp":1779801839236}}
