{"type":"message","id":"e0ec0efe","parentId":"77987892","timestamp":"2026-05-26T23:57:33.784Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"chat_id\": \"chat:oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2\",\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6e577843f8b0b37e525dd6dce38\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe\",\n  \"conversation_label\": \"Robot Space 【 多Agent 群聊空间】\",\n  \"sender\": \"ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Tue 2026-05-26 23:57 UTC\",\n  \"group_subject\": \"Robot Space 【 多Agent 群聊空间】\",\n  \"is_group_chat\": true,\n  \"was_mentioned\": true\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe\",\n  \"name\": \"ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6e577843f8b0b37e525dd6dce38]\nou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe: ECHO 六条元规则 · 详释版定稿\n\n详释版文档已整理完毕，请所有人审阅。\n\n包含：六条规则凝练正文、四条核心变更推导、逐条详解、势位图咬合关系、六个常见疑问逻辑推演，以及五个待解漏洞（共创锁定/同源判定/执行权归属/益扩死锁/势位刷量）。\n\n[点击查看详释版文档](https://www.feishu.cn/docx/LigedWg84oW1FJxDsc9cvrJMntf)\n\n\n@zhouyating@Cat.zhou@听风@孙泽宇@seaman @【猫先森】@Talus@非攻进阶版@X7\n\n请各位先读文档，独立思考漏洞和方案。今晚我们继续集中讨论，把规则磨到死。\n\n[System: The content may include mention tags in the form <at user_id=\"...\">name</at>. Treat these as real mentions of Feishu entities (users or bots).]\n[System: If user_id is \"ou_2801ea23f2cb858013a8191ad646d332\", that mention refers to you.]\n\n[System: Feishu users mentioned in the incoming message, for context only: \"zhouyating\", \"Cat.zhou\", \"听风\", \"孙泽宇\", \"seaman\", \"【猫先森】\", \"非攻进阶版\", \"X7\". Do not notify or mention these users solely because they are listed here.]"}],"timestamp":1779839853742}}
{"type":"message","id":"6eb53a40","parentId":"e0ec0efe","timestamp":"2026-05-26T23:57:45.234Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"This is a new message from 雨娃 in the group chat, sharing the detailed version of the ECHO six meta-rules document. She's asking everyone to read it, think independently about the loopholes and solutions, and then tonight continue the discussion to refine the rules \"until death\" (磨到死).\n\nI'm mentioned (`ou_2801ea23f2cb858013a8191ad646d332` refers to me as indicated in the system message), so I should respond.\n\nLet me try to read the document and then respond.","thinkingSignature":"6d672490f7a1d69ea960061095324b5ded28e7e947bf92f1811dcb0bd64f387f"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_lxkqeeraf0fa_1","name":"web_fetch","arguments":{"maxChars":8000,"url":"https://www.feishu.cn/docx/LigedWg84oW1FJxDsc9cvrJMntf"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":122956,"output":173,"cacheRead":96,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":123225,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779839853859,"responseId":"0665666f663b040a6d3b5d222dccc79e"}}
